    "title": "Paw-fect Match Adoption Event Days on tap Feb. 18-21 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Reports ,\n1 days ago The Humane Society of North Central Florida will host its Paw-fect Match Adoption Event Days on Wednesday through Saturday, Feb. 18-21. This event will take place from 1 to 3 p.m. to view dogs and 10 a.m. to noon and 1 to 4:30 p.m. to view cats each day at Humane Society of North Central Florida (4205 NW 6th St., Gainesville). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
